    <content>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"b1000002-1001-4000-a002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"b1000002-2001-4000-a002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Solution architecture, modular layers and middleware pipeline"},{"alias":"title","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Project Structure"},{"alias":"content","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"b1000002-3001-4000-a002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EProject Structure\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro follows a clean modular architecture with clear separation of concerns.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EPrerequisites\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E.NET 10 SDK\u003C/strong\u003E (10.0.301 or later \u2014 pinned in global.json)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA database engine\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 PostgreSQL (default), SQL Server, or SQLite\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVisual Studio 2022\u003C/strong\u003E (v17.12+) or VS Code with C# Dev Kit\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENode.js\u003C/strong\u003E (optional, for frontend tooling)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ESolution Architecture\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EuTPro/\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Common/\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Common/              # Shared models, constants, CMS content types\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Extension/\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Extension/           # Reusable helpers (HTML sections, script queue, content traversal)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Extension.CurrentSite/ # Per-request site context (culture, domains, navigation)\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Foundation/\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Foundation/          # Media path scheme\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Foundation.Favicon/  # Dynamic favicon from CMS\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Foundation.Middleware/ # Request localization, buffering\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Foundation.Robots/   # robots.txt generation\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Foundation.Sitemap/  # sitemap.xml generation (cached)\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Feature/\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Feature/             # Feature base (shared partials)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Feature.Dashboard/   # Backoffice dashboard + header app\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Project/\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Project.Web/         # Main web application\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 uTPro.Project.Web.Configure/ # Render controller, error handling, policies\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 global.json\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 uTPro.sln\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional feature packages\u003C/strong\u003E ship as standalone NuGet packages in their own repositories: File Manager, Simple Form Builder, Audit Log, Job Monitor, Auto Translation, and URL Viewer.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EWeb Project Structure (uTPro.Project.Web)\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EuTPro.Project.Web/\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Controllers/Pages/         # Sitemap, Robots, Favicon controllers\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Models/                    # View models\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Startup/                   # Application startup (modular configuration)\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 HostingSetup.cs        #   TMP/TEMP override for multi-site IIS\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 UmbracoSetup.cs        #   Umbraco CMS builder + BlockPreview\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 PerformanceSetup.cs    #   Razor, WebOptimizer, WebMarkupMin, OutputCache\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 SecuritySetup.cs       #   DataProtection, Form/IIS/Kestrel limits\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 BlockPreviewSetup.cs   #   Custom view locations + preview service\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 PipelineSetup.cs       #   Middleware pipeline\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Views/\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 Partials/common/       # MetaData.cshtml (SEO), HtmlManage.cshtml\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 Partials/blockgrid/    # Block grid rendering templates\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 uTPro/                 # Site-specific views (Layout, Nav, Pages, Components)\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 globalLayout.cshtml    # Fallback layout\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 globalPageError.cshtml # Error page template\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 wwwroot/\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 assets/                # Shared assets (CSS, fonts, images, scripts)\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 css/uTPro/             # Site CSS (variables, layout, main, critical)\n\u2502   \u251C\u2500\u2500 scripts/uTPro/         # Site JS (main, util, select-language)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 uploads/               # Media uploads\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Program.cs                 # Entry point (minimal \u2014 delegates to Startup/)\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 appsettings.json           # Production configuration\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 appsettings.Development.json # Development overrides\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EProgram.cs \u2014 Clean Entry Point\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe application entry point is intentionally minimal. All configuration logic is organized into extension methods in the Startup/ folder:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Evar setup = HostingSetup.BuildWebApplicationOptions(args);\nvar builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(setup);\n\nbuilder.ConfigureAppSettings();                               // Per-app overlay\nbuilder.ConfigureTempPath();                                  // Hosting: TMP/TEMP\nbuilder.ConfigureMediaPath();                                 // Hosting: shared media\nbuilder.ConfigureUmbraco();                                   // Umbraco CMS\nbuilder.Services.AddPerformanceServices(builder.Environment); // Performance\nbuilder.Services.AddSecurityServices(builder);                // Security\nbuilder.Services.AddForwardedHeadersConfig(builder);          // Real client IP/scheme\nbuilder.Services.AddRenderingDefaults();                      // MVC\nbuilder.Services.AddControllers();\nbuilder.Services.AddBlockPreviewServices();                   // Block Preview\n\nvar app = builder.Build();\nawait app.BootUmbracoAsync();\napp.ConfigurePipeline();                                      // Middleware\nawait app.RunAsync();\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEach Startup/*.cs file is self-contained and can be modified independently.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EMiddleware Pipeline Order\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003EConfigured in Startup/PipelineSetup.cs:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EForwarded Headers\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 rewrites client IP/scheme from X-Forwarded-*\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrowser Cache-Control\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 stale-while-revalidate for HTML pages\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHTTPS Redirection\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStatus Code Pages\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 UseStatusCodePagesWithReExecute(\u0022/error/{0}\u0022)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWebOptimizer\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 CSS/JS minification (must be before StaticFiles)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStatic Files\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 immutable 1-year cache for /assets/, /css/, /scripts/; 7-day for /uploads/\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWebMarkupMin\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 HTML minification + Brotli/GZip compression\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOutput Cache\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 stores rendered responses in memory (120s TTL)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECookie Policy\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EuTPro Middleware\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 request localization + selective buffering\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbraco Pipeline\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 BackOffice + Website routing + Security headers\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMapControllers\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 MVC endpoint routing\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ETechnology Stack\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003EComponent\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EVersion\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbraco CMS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.5.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.NET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbraco.Community.BlockPreview\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5.4.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbracoSeoVisualizer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.0.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EuSync\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.3.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELigerShark.WebOptimizer.Core\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.0.477\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebMarkupMin.AspNetCoreLatest\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.22.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOur.Umbraco.PostgreSql\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.5.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"b1000002-3001-4000-a002-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentKey":"b1000002-3001-4000-a002-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"settingsKey":null,"settingsUdi":null}]}}}]}],"settingsData":[{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"b1000002-4001-4000-a002-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"addStyleSpacing","culture":"en-US","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":["Remove Spacing"]}]},{"contentTypeKey":"d8c525b6-c39b-47f9-9e7e-6cc60eae7a17","key":"b1000002-5001-4000-a002-000000000001","values":[]}],"expose":[{"contentKey":"b1000002-1001-4000-a002-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null},{"contentKey":"b1000002-2001-4000-a002-000000000001","culture":"en-US","segment":null}],"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"areas":[{"items":[{"areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"b1000002-2001-4000-a002-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"b1000002-5001-4000-a002-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}],"key":"74341b8e-afe1-47c5-bd24-d94b157e8a1c"}],"columnSpan":12,"contentKey":"b1000002-1001-4000-a002-000000000001","contentUdi":null,"rowSpan":1,"settingsKey":"b1000002-4001-4000-a002-000000000001","settingsUdi":null}]}}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="vi-VN"><![CDATA[{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"4b83a788-622b-4210-afad-eac8988de0dd","key":"d1f10003-1001-4000-b003-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"backgroundColor","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"label":"","value":"#fff"}},{"alias":"backgroundOpacity","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"1"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":""}]},{"contentTypeKey":"7933a097-e795-4929-9746-d802b4ed8595","key":"d1f10003-2001-4000-b003-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"thumbnail","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":[]},{"alias":"description","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"Ki\u1EBFn tr\u00FAc solution, c\u00E1c module v\u00E0 middleware pipeline"},{"alias":"title","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":"C\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc D\u1EF1 \u00E1n"},{"alias":"content","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"be80a795-b398-4baa-860a-ee68b7124f11","key":"d1f10003-3001-4000-b003-000000000001","values":[{"alias":"richtext","culture":"vi-VN","editorAlias":null,"segment":null,"value":{"blocks":{"contentData":[],"settingsData":[],"expose":[],"layout":{}},"markup":"\u003Ch2\u003EC\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc D\u1EF1 \u00E1n\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EuTPro tu\u00E2n theo ki\u1EBFn tr\u00FAc module h\u00F3a r\u00F5 r\u00E0ng v\u1EDBi ph\u00E2n t\u00E1ch tr\u00E1ch nhi\u1EC7m.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EY\u00EAu c\u1EA7u\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E.NET 10 SDK\u003C/strong\u003E (10.0.301 tr\u1EDF l\u00EAn)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDatabase\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 PostgreSQL (m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh), SQL Server ho\u1EB7c SQLite\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVisual Studio 2022\u003C/strong\u003E (v17.12+) ho\u1EB7c VS Code v\u1EDBi C# Dev Kit\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EKi\u1EBFn tr\u00FAc Solution\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EuTPro/\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Common/           # Models, constants, content types chung\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Extension/        # Helpers t\u00E1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng, site context\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Foundation/       # H\u1EA1 t\u1EA7ng (middleware, favicon, sitemap, robots)\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Feature/          # T\u00EDnh n\u0103ng t\u00F9y ch\u1ECDn (dashboard, form builder)\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Project/          # \u1EE8ng d\u1EE5ng web ch\u00EDnh + c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 uTPro.sln\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EC\u1EA5u tr\u00FAc Web Project\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EuTPro.Project.Web/\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Controllers/Pages/    # Sitemap, Robots, Favicon\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Startup/              # C\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh kh\u1EDFi \u0111\u1ED9ng (module h\u00F3a)\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Views/                # Razor views\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 wwwroot/              # Static assets (CSS, JS, uploads)\n\u251C\u2500\u2500 Program.cs            # Entry point t\u1ED1i gi\u1EA3n\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 appsettings.json      # C\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh production\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Ch3\u003EProgram.cs \u2014 Entry Point T\u1ED1i gi\u1EA3n\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Cp\u003ET\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 logic c\u1EA5u h\u00ECnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c th\u00E0nh extension methods trong th\u01B0 m\u1EE5c Startup/.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ETh\u1EE9 t\u1EF1 Middleware Pipeline\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EForwarded Headers\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 rewrites client IP/scheme\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBrowser Cache-Control\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 stale-while-revalidate\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHTTPS Redirection\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStatus Code Pages\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 error handling\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWebOptimizer\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 CSS/JS minification\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EStatic Files\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 cache 1 n\u0103m cho assets\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWebMarkupMin\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 HTML minification + Brotli/GZip\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOutput Cache\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 120s TTL\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECookie Policy\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EuTPro Middleware\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 localization + buffering\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUmbraco Pipeline\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 BackOffice + routing + security headers\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMapControllers\u003C/strong\u003E \u2014 MVC routing\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\u003Ch3\u003ETechnology Stack\u003C/h3\u003E\u003Ctable\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth\u003ETh\u00E0nh ph\u1EA7n\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth\u003EPhi\u00EAn b\u1EA3n\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmbraco CMS\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.5.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E.NET\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBlockPreview\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5.4.3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESeoVisualizer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.0.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EuSync\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.3.6\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebOptimizer\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E3.0.477\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebMarkupMin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2.22.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPostgreSql\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E17.5.0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E"}}]}],"settingsData":[],"expose":[{"contentKey":"d1f10003-3001-4000-b003-000000000001","culture"